# Default: ignore everything, then explicitly allow tracked project paths.
*

# Core repository file
!.gitignore

# Top-level project container
!모두의피알(EveryonePR)/
!모두의피알(EveryonePR)/**

# Runtime artifacts to keep out of Git
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/05_로컬백업-LocalBackup/*.tar.gz
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/06_운영로그-OpsLogs/*.log
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/01_서비스코드-ServiceCode/.env.supabase
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/01_서비스코드-ServiceCode/.env.cloudflare
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/08_데이터베이스-Database/04_백업-Backups/*.tar.gz
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/08_데이터베이스-Database/03_동기화로그-SyncLogs/*.json
모두의피알(EveryonePR)/.wrangler/
